v. United States', 'extracted_date': '1989', 'url': 'https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/112173/mistretta-v-united-states/', 'source': 'citation_clustering', 'citations': [{'citation': '488 U.S. 361', 'extracted_case_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'extracted_date': '1989', 'canonical_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'canonical_date': '1989-01-18', 'confidence': 1.0, 'source': 'CourtListener-lookup', 'url': 'https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/112173/mistretta-v-united-states/', 'court': None, 'context': 'ore \nappropriate to another branch and that its institutional \nintegrity be protected. Carrick, 125 Wn.2d at 136 \n(citing Mistretta v. United States, 488 U.S. 361, 383, 109 S. \nCt. 647,', 'verified': True, 'parallel_citations': []}, {'citation': '109 S. Ct. 647', 'extracted_case_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'extracted_date': '1989', 'canonical_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'canonical_date': '1989-01-18', 'confidence': 1.0, 'source': 'CourtListener-lookup', 'url': 'https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/112173/mistretta-v-united-states/', 'court': None, 'context': 'another branch and that its institutional \nintegrity be protected. Carrick, 125 Wn.2d at 136 \n(citing Mistretta v. United States, 488 U.S. 361, 383, 109 S. \nCt. 647,', 'verified': True, 'parallel_citations': []}, {'citation': '102 L. Ed. 2d 714', 'extracted_case_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'extracted_date': '1989', 'canonical_name': 'Mistretta v. United States', 'canonical_date': '1989-01-18', 'confidence': 0.9, 'source': 'CourtListener-lookup', 'url': 'https://www.courtlistener.com/opinion/112173/mistretta-v-united-states/', 'court': None, 'context': 'S. \nCt. 647, 102 L. Ed. 2d 714 (1989)', 'verified': True, 'parallel_citations': []}], 'has_parallel_citations': True, 'size': 3}], 'statistics': {'total_citations': 9, 'text_length': 4945}}
